      "writtenOn": "2022-10-06T21:08:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This really isn\u0027t a poll function.  As implemented:\nread \u003d read cached value\npoll \u003d update cached value\n\nHow about using `read_cached`, and `update_temperature` in place of read/poll?",
